# Testing

- Backend unit: `cd backend && npm test`
- Frontend unit: `cd frontend && npm test`
- Full gate: `npm run check` (repo root — lint, tests, build)
- Backend e2e: `cd backend && npm run test:e2e`
- Tests never send email (SMTP is skipped under Jest; e2e overrides `EmailService`)
- Local `start:dev` also stays silent unless `MAIL_ENABLED=true` (case-insensitive; `False` counts as off)
- Ticket changes: walk the status flow in `backend/GUIDE.md`
- Test suites / bugs: follow `TEST_SUITES_PLAN.md` §4.8 and `.cursor/rules/testing-domain.mdc`
- Role checks: reproduce with accounts in `QA_TESTING.md` (`barmijly-qa-testing` skill)
- New endpoint: hit Swagger `http://localhost:3001/api/docs`, then the matching frontend hook
- Do not add English-only assertions for UI copy — labels live in `constants.ts`
- New/changed UI: vitest + RTL spec beside the component; verify 360px and `lg` (`responsive-ui.mdc`)
